{"content":[{"c":["AZAREL"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Warrior from Benjamin’s tribe who joined David at Ziklag in his struggle against King Saul. Azarel was one of David’s ambidextrous archers and slingers (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.12.2,6","r":"1Chr.12.2,6","rawR":"1Chr.12.2,6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.12.2,6","value":"1Chr.12.2,6"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 12:2, 6"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Levite selected by David to assist in the music of the sanctuary (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.25.18","r":"1Chr.25.18","rawR":"1Chr.25.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.25.18","value":"1Chr.25.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 25:18"},", ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," “Uzziel”)."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Chief of Dan’s tribe appointed by David to be tribal leader during David’s ill-fated census (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.27.22","r":"1Chr.27.22","rawR":"1Chr.27.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.27.22","value":"1Chr.27.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 27:22"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Israelite of the family of Binnui who obeyed Ezra’s exhortation to divorce his pagan wife after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.41","r":"Ezra.10.41","rawR":"Ezra.10.41","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.41","value":"Ezra.10.41"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:41"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Amashsai’s father. Amashsai was a priest of Immer’s family who lived in Jerusalem after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.13","r":"Neh.11.13","rawR":"Neh.11.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.13","value":"Neh.11.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:13"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["6. Priest who blew a trumpet at the dedication of the wall of Jerusalem after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.36","r":"Neh.12.36","rawR":"Neh.12.36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.36","value":"Neh.12.36"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 12:36"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Azarel","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 12:2, 6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.12.2,6","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.12.2,6","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.12.2,6"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 25:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.25.18","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.25.18","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.25.18"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 27:22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.27.22","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.27.22","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.27.22"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:41","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.41","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.41","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.41"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.13","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.13","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.13"},{"anchorText":"Neh 12:36","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.36","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.36","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.36"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"1932c30f0b1931564c5d1ced7565a65569e82339743f90db56a33986323a6e75","sourceItemName":"Azarel","sourceItemOrder":640,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Azarel","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Azarel","title":"Azarel","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}